soft viability sensors

AND

all hard anchors

share:
the same corruption,

the tested endogenous credit stack fails completely.

Again:

NO FINITE SET OF INTERNALLY CORRUPTED MEASUREMENTS
CAN MANUFACTURE
GROUND TRUTH.

H89 reduces:
attack surface.

It does not eliminate:
identifiability limits.

